title: "Skill Repo Architecture"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-11
license: MIT
type: software
description: "Design principles for structuring, shipping, and maintaining agent skill repositories at the repo level — methodology over collection, declared shipping boundaries, proportionate anti-drift, heuristic discovery, self-verifying instructions, cross-project pattern preservation, file-swamp diagnosis, portability gradations, information density analysis, and evaluation rubric/CI triage."